# rdfs-range: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/rdfs-range.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:teaches rdfs:range :Subject. :alice :teaches :logic.

# Inference rules
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.

{?P rdfs:range ?C. ?X ?P ?Y} => {?Y a ?C}.
